[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:39. Don't Drop It]
[00:00.780]Lesson 39.|第39课。
[00:02.780]What are you going to do with that vase, Mary?|玛丽，你要把那个花瓶怎么样？
[00:06.105]I'm going to put it on the radio, John.|约翰，我要把它放在收音机上。
[00:09.540]Don't do that. Give it to me.|别那样做。给我。
[00:13.095]What are you going to do with it?|你要把它怎么样？
[00:15.890]I'm going to put it here, in front of the window.|我要把它放在这里，窗户前面。
[00:19.625]Be careful!|小心！
[00:21.740]Don't drop it!|别把它掉了！
[00:24.250]Don't put it there, John. Put it here, on this shelf.|约翰，别把它放在那里。把它放在这里，这个架子上。
[00:30.395]There we are.|好了。
[00:32.465]It's a lovely vase.|这是个漂亮的花瓶。
[00:35.180]Those flowers are lovely too.|这些花也很漂亮。